ub.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/38979","id":698555673,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY5ODU1NTY3Mw==","user":{"login":"JoostK","id":123679,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzY3OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123679?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK","html_url":"https://github.com/JoostK","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-09-24T19:54:26Z","updated_at":"2020-09-24T19:54:26Z","body":"Confirming as reported, it's indeed a bug in ngtsc (the Ivy compiler).\r\n\r\nThe issue occurs due to how template type checking is done; a `ts.CompilerHost` is created to expose the type check files:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/angular/angular/blob/9e8fa0748f1f8b3b83c0dae8b829bb712241dd69/packages/compiler-cli/src/ngtsc/typecheck/src/host.ts#L17\r\n\r\nThis host does not implement all optional methods, one of which is `directoryExists`, so that `@types` discovery does not trigger here. This type check program is then reused for the the next compilation, resulting in the primary emit program from also missing these types (I think because module resolution results were reused).\r\n\r\nIn ngc I'm seeing every other compile to fail, as the failure throws away any reuse program as it's deemed invalid. This allows the next compilation to succeed again. I didn't test with the CLI but it may not show that behaviour and always fail instead.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/698555673/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"JoostK","id":123679,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzY3OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123679?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK","html_url":"https://github.com/JoostK","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":3804848023,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDM4MDQ4NDgwMjM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/events/3804848023","actor":{"login":"JoostK","id":123679,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzY3OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123679?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK","html_url":"https://github.com/JoostK","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoostK/subscriptions","organizations